<DocsLayout title="Shortest-path reference" kicker="15 / reference" description="Exact and bounded-hop shortest-path functions for weighted directed graphs.">
  <pre><code>from reachq.shortest_paths import (
    dijkstra,
    shortest_path,
    shortest_path_hopbound,
    truncated_dijkstra,
)
from reachq.hopset import build_hopset_for_sssp</code></pre>
  <p><code>dijkstra</code> returns exact source distances. <code>shortest_path_hopbound</code> searches the original graph plus hopset edges with a maximum hop count. It returns a mapping for vertices reachable within that budget.</p>
</DocsLayout>
